EIZPORT_SHORT_DESCRIPTION

== Description ==

This plugin carries content exported from another WordPress site with Eizport (https://eizport.github.io/): pages, posts, media and settings, in one bundle. Once activated, its screen — Run import, on its row on the Plugins screen — imports the bundle with the WordPress Importer, then offers to delete this plugin.

Eizport draws that screen and runs the import; without it, the same screen lists Eizport first, with a button to install, activate or update it.

== External services ==

"Install Now" and "Update now" install or update Eizport or the WordPress Importer from the WordPress.org plugin directory (api.wordpress.org, downloads.wordpress.org), through WordPress's own installer, only when you click them: the request carries the plugin's name and what WordPress sends with every such request (its version, the site's language and address). WordPress.org privacy policy: https://wordpress.org/about/privacy/

Like the WordPress Importer, the import downloads media files the bundle doesn't include from their original addresses.
